      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Configuration means instruction/settings \nprovided to the spring container .\n\n2. Configuartaion helps the container to define \nand manage various context of application .\n\n3. There are lot of configuration in spring like .\n\n--> bean definition\n--> dependency injection .\n--> Bean lifecycle \n--> database configuration\n--> Bean autowiring\n--> security configuration \n    etc  .... ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Configuration means instruction/settings \nprovided to the spring container .\n\n2. Configuartaion helps the container to define \nand manage various context of application .\n\n3. There are lot of configuration in spring like .\n\n--> bean definition\n--> dependency injection .\n--> Bean lifecycle \n--> database configuration\n--> Bean autowiring\n--> security configuration \n    etc  .... ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2gVA96aF_eMiOxeEdx9iI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 238,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 665,
      "height": 1750,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
